  "decision": "The complete original patch adds standalone:false to the private modern AsyncMultiSelectionChipListbox fixture. It changes Angular component metadata and is not type-only. That class and the modern chip-listbox fixture are absent from the owned historical chip suite. The actual historical test adapter already inserts standalone:false only when metadata omits standalone, and preserves explicit true and false; three executed source adapter controls cover those cases. Keep the independently owned legacy chip list and existing adapter. This conclusion neither imports the modern fixture nor proves actual Angular forms/chip behavior or compiler/peer floors.",
